# The actual private target number (see DonationNagView.swift's targetChecksumHash) — the ONLY
# copy of this outside a one-way hash. Never committed; back it up somewhere private if this repo
# checkout is ever lost, or the donation-nag unlock becomes unrecoverable without brute-forcing.
/tools/donation_target.txt
